Vendored e-invoicing validation artefacts (W4-C)

xsd/ubl-2.1/
  OASIS Universal Business Language (UBL) 2.1 schemas, Copyright (c) OASIS Open 2013,
  distributed under the OASIS IPR policy notice contained in each file. Taken from
  github.com/phax/ph-ubl (ph-ubl21/src/main/resources/external/schemas/ubl21), with the
  CCTS, XMLDSig and XAdES modules from github.com/phax/ph-xsds. The only change: xsd:import
  elements that ph-ubl resolves through a catalog were given their original OASIS
  relative schemaLocation values so the tree validates standalone.

schematron/2026.5/
  OpenPeppol PINT AE (UAE) billing schematron, release 2026.5 (aka 1.0.4), Copyright (C)
  2020-2023 OpenPEPPOL AISBL, Apache License 2.0. Pre-processed XSLT as published in
  github.com/phax/phive-rules (phive-rules-peppol-pint/src/main/resources/external/
  schematron/pint-ae/2026.5/billing). The *.sef.json files are the same XSLT compiled
  for saxon-js with Saxonica xslt3 2.7.0 (`node scripts/validate-ubl.mjs --compile`).

Update procedure: replace the XSLT with the next OpenPeppol release, rerun --compile,
then `npx vitest run tests/unit/einvoice-pint-ae.test.ts`.
